  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The de-Broglie wavelength of a particle having kinetic energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>.</mo></math> How much extra energy must be given to this particle so that the de-Broglie wavelength reduces to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;of the initial value?",
    "image": null
  },
